# Output of backend/eval/run_eval.py. Deliberately NOT committed: it is the
# measurement of one particular run against one particular database. Committing
# it would make GET /kpi/model-performance serve somebody else's numbers on a
# fresh clone, presented as if this system had been measured — which is the
# exact thing the endpoint's 404-until-measured behaviour exists to prevent.
